          <footer class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-[#625C53]">
            เจ้าของธุรกิจ B2B Manufacturing / Distribution (สงวนชื่อบริษัทตามคำขอ)
            <a href="/case-studies/forklift-distributor-5-person-team" class="ml-1 font-semibold text-coral underline decoration-coral/40 underline-offset-4 hover:text-navy focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-coral">อ่านเคสจริง →</a>
          </footer>
